# Worker secrets. The Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for the uncommented one on its setup page.
# For local development: copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored) and fill in fresh values. Never commit .dev.vars.

# 32 random bytes, base64. Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# Wraps every project key. Back it up offline first: losing it loses every secret.
ANCHOR_ROOT_KEY=

# Optional. The id stored with every project key wrapped by ANCHOR_ROOT_KEY (default rk1).
# ANCHOR_ROOT_KEY_ID=rk1
# Only while rotating the root key (https://sotarak.github.io/anchor/operations/root-key-rotation/): the old key and its id.
# ANCHOR_ROOT_KEY_PREVIOUS=
# ANCHOR_ROOT_KEY_PREVIOUS_ID=
